            "block_id": "statement",
            "text": "Northstar Medtech annual segment and consolidated disclosures. Amounts in USD millions. FY2024 covers July 1, 2023 through June 30, 2024. FY2023 covers July 1, 2022 through June 30, 2023. Columns: FY2024 FY2023.\nSensors segment revenue 55 50\nConsolidated revenue 100 90\nAdjusted cash earnings 8 7",
