          {
            "source_snapshot_id": "northstar-disclosure-b",
            "block_id": "note-detail",
            "text": "Note 2. Effective July 1, 2023, the Sensors segment presentation changed. FY2023 Sensors segment revenue was recast to USD 50 million for comparability with FY2024. FY2024 segment revenue was already prepared under the new presentation. This segment presentation change did not affect the consolidated financial statements for either FY2024 or FY2023. Adjusted cash earnings is a company-defined measure; see Note 7 for its definition and reconciliation.",
